msgctxt "928"
msgid ""
"I have to thank you for the match, Kiryu-san. Golf isn't\r\n"
"much without an enjoyable conversation to go with it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid ""
"I hope I'll have the chance to stop by your orphanage\r\n"
"sometime soon. And I mean that sincerely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid "We'd love to have you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid ""
"Perhaps there's even some way the city could support all\r\n"
"the charitable work you do for those children."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid ""
"If you ever need anything, please feel free to give me\r\n"
"a call. I'll do everything within my power to help you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid "I appreciate that, Akasaka-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid "Farewell, now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid "See you later."
msgstr "Ci vediamo."

msgctxt "1024"
msgid ""
"Ah, and before I forget. I signed you up on my permanent\r\n"
"guest list, so you'll be free to visit the club whenever\r\n"
"you please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid "Perhaps we'll even play again some time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid "I hope so."
msgstr "Spero di sì..."

msgctxt "1072"
msgid "Welcome, sir. Are you a member of our club?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid "Well, no. I, uh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid "Ah, so you're a visitor. Do you have a guest pass?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr "Ehm..."

msgctxt "1120"
msgid ""
"My deepest apologies, sir, but this is a highly exclusive\r\n"
"club for local businessmen and government officials only."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1132"
msgid ""
"If you don't have an invitation from a current member,\r\n"
"I'm going to have to ask you to leave."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1144"
msgid "I'm very sorry, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1156"
msgid ""
"(Dammit. How am I ever gonna find Akasaka if I can't even\r\n"
"get in the club?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1168"
msgid "If you'll allow me to intrude..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1180"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "Mh?"

msgctxt "1192"
msgid "I hear you don't have a guest pass."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1204"
msgid "Yeah, I didn't realize this was a private club..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1216"
msgid "In that case, why don't you join me for a couple of holes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1228"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "1240"
msgid ""
"I was actually meant to meet a friend here, but it seems\r\n"
"he won't be showing up. I suppose he had some last-minute\r\n"
"business to attend to."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1252"
msgid ""
"I'm not too fond of playing by myself, though, so if you\r\n"
"wouldn't mind joining me, I'd be glad to have you along."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1264"
msgid "And... who are you exactly?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1276"
msgid "Ah, where are my manners? My name is Akasaka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1288"
msgid "You mean from the city council?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1300"
msgid "Ah, I take it you've heard of me. May I ask your name?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1312"
msgid "It's Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1324"
msgid "Well then, Kiryu-san. Shall we play?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1336"
msgid "Yeah, let's do it."
msgstr "Sì, andiamo."

msgctxt "1348"
msgid ""
"(Talk about luck. This is the perfect chance for me to\r\n"
"get closer to Akasaka.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1372"
msgid "Welcome. How can I help you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1396"
msgid "Uncle Kaz! Get at least +2 in Competition Mode!"
msgstr "Zio Kaz! Fai almeno +2 nella Modalità Competizione!"

msgctxt "1408"
msgid "(At least +2 in Competition Mode, eh...? Should I try it?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1420"
msgid "Not right now."
msgstr "Non adesso."

msgctxt "1432"
msgid "All right. Please come again."
msgstr "Va bene. Torni a trovarci."

msgctxt "1444"
msgid "Aww! But I want to watch you play golf!"
msgstr "Uffa! Ma voglio vederti giocare a golf!"

msgctxt "1456"
msgid "Sure, I'll enter the competition."
msgstr "Va bene, mi iscrivo alla competizione."

msgctxt "1468"
msgid "Very well. The fee is 5,000 yen."
msgstr "Benissimo. La quota è di 2.500 yen."

msgctxt "1492"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "Va bene."

msgctxt "1504"
msgid "All right. Best of luck to you."
msgstr "Molto bene. Le auguro buona fortuna."

msgctxt "1516"
msgid "Good luck, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr "Buona fortuna, zio Kaz!"

